  "description": "Meet the LŪMA Meridian — your ultimate all-surface weapon. Engineered with progressive geometry, massive 50mm tire clearance, and fully loaded with mounting provisions, this machine is built to dominate any surface you throw at it. Pavement, gravel, singletrack — or a savage blend of all three — Meridian doesn’t flinch.\n\nOne bike. Infinite possibilities.\nIf your adventure doesn’t come with limits, neither should your ride.\n\nLet's talk about bikes! Schedule uninterrupted time to chat about Meridian. Book time now!\n\nStandard Features:\n\nGrade 9 Seamless, Double Butted 3Al/2.5V Titanium\n\nLŪMA Carbon Fiber Fork with Accessory Mounts\n\nT47 Threaded Bottom Bracke\n\nFull Assortment of Rack, Bottle, and Fender Mounts\n\nUDH Derailleur Hanger (run traditional derailleur or SRAM Full Mount)\n\n700x50c Tire Clearance\n\nDi2, AXS And Mechanical Shifting Compatibility\n\nTraditional Internal Cable Routing\n\nFull Internal Cable Routing Compatible with Ported and Polished Head Tube Port\n\nLet's talk about bikes! Schedule uninterrupted time to chat about Meridian. Book time now!",
